WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.734
-Guys, we have exactly
eight shows left

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:04.901
before we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time

00:00:04.901 --> 00:00:06.901
for that beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:09.834
It's time for
"12 Days of Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:11.167
♪♪

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:13.501
-♪ 12 days
of Christmas sweaters ♪

00:00:13.501 --> 00:00:16.667
♪ 8 days left ♪

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:18.834
-That is right!

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:21.334
Every show between now
and Christmas,

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:23.834
we'll be giving one lucky
audience member

00:00:23.834 --> 00:00:26.167
a jaw-dropping Christmas sweater

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:28.667
from the Countdown to Christmas
Cabinet.

00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:31.167
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Now, since -- Oh, yeah.

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:32.834
We don't mess around.

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:35.167
Since there are
eight shows left,

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:38.501
let's open door number eight.

00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:40.334
Where is it?

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:43.667
Oh, even just the door --
even the door looks exciting.

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:46.167
Alright. Let's see it.

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:48.167
Wow. I need more.
I need more. Let's see.

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:50.167
Let's take it out.
Let's see what it is.

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:52.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Ohh.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.100
Oh.
-Ooh!

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.734
-Wow.

00:00:57.734 --> 00:00:59.067
That's interesting.

00:00:59.067 --> 00:01:00.467
It's like a bonus.

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:02.601
There's, like,
a floating collar.

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:04.434
There's, like,
a bonus collar there.

00:01:04.434 --> 00:01:05.767
that's like a floating collar.

00:01:05.767 --> 00:01:07.767
Let's see the back.
Let's see.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:09.801
Ohh!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:09.801 --> 00:01:11.801
From "The Tonight Show."

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:14.467
A holiday fruit cake.

00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:16.501
Alright, let's see who's gonna
go home with tonight's sweater.

00:01:16.501 --> 00:01:18.334
Everyone look at your
seat number, okay?

00:01:18.334 --> 00:01:20.667
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:22.467
Quest, can I get
a drum roll, please?

00:01:22.467 --> 00:01:23.467
[ Drum roll ]
Who wants this one?

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:24.834
It's a good one.

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:26.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:31.534
419!

00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:35.367
Can we unzip it?
Unzip it, unzip it.

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:42.701
♪♪

00:01:42.701 --> 00:01:44.534
Hi, bud! Hi!

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:46.200
[ Laughs ]

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:47.834
Come on!

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:52.801
We have the best audience
in the world.

00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:54.234
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Can I put it on?

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:55.400
-What is your name?

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:57.234
-I'm Paige.
It's so nice to meet you.

00:01:57.234 --> 00:01:59.067
-Hey, where you from?
-I'm from Chicago.

00:01:59.067 --> 00:02:00.434
-Hey, welcome.

00:02:00.434 --> 00:02:01.968
I'm so happy that you're here.
-Thank you so much!

00:02:01.968 --> 00:02:03.467
-Thank you for being here.

00:02:03.467 --> 00:02:05.133
Now, it's very cold in Chicago.

00:02:05.133 --> 00:02:06.968
Even when it's warm,
it's cold in Chicago.

00:02:06.968 --> 00:02:08.801
Do you have anything like this?

00:02:08.801 --> 00:02:11.300
-I have nothing like this.
The lapels are gorgeous.

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:13.801
-Thank you so much.
I stitched it myself.

00:02:13.801 --> 00:02:16.300
Would you like to try it on?
-I would love to try it on.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:18.133
-Okay, here we go.

00:02:18.133 --> 00:02:19.467
[ Audience cheering ]
Oh, this is good.

00:02:19.467 --> 00:02:21.634
You can tell already.
Gorgeous.

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:24.133
Do you want to zip it?
Try zipping it.

00:02:24.133 --> 00:02:25.968
Yeah, you got to zip it.

00:02:25.968 --> 00:02:27.300
-Oh, yeah.
-Yes!

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:28.467
Look at this.

00:02:28.467 --> 00:02:30.634
Look at that.
Are you kidding me?

00:02:30.634 --> 00:02:32.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.467
Supermodel!
Thank you so much.

00:02:34.467 --> 00:02:36.133
Congratulations again.

00:02:36.133 --> 00:02:37.300
Guys, stick around.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:38.634
We're playing "Can You Feel It"

00:02:38.634 --> 00:02:40.300
with Nicole Kidman
after the break.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:41.467
Come on back.

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:46.801
♪♪

00:02:46.801 --> 00:02:52.133
♪♪

